{"version":2,"kind":"Article","sha256":"5e617016e8071883415586ce78cef20bd24a81a29ebfa91feb924ae8877b5062","slug":"sensor-de-giro","location":"/sensor-de-giro.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Alineación del sensor de giro","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"I ♥ roady","given":"I ♥","family":"roady"},"name":"I ♥ roady","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/executablebooks/jupyter-book","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/executablebooks/jupyter-book/blob/master/sensor-de-giro.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/executablebooks/jupyter-book/edit/master/sensor-de-giro.md","thumbnail":"/build/1-83c508a786bbc20756f973c83e28a48d.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"sensor-de-giro.md","url":"/build/sensor-de-giro-0c608fba34560512d4aec56abb26da6b.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"(by Josep)","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"ZSRlaPmNSK"}],"key":"fmeQAvKVQ5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Para sacar el volante ponlo completamente centrado para que el tornillo del\nvolante bloquee el sensor del esp, al moverlo un diente y ponerlo otra vez, no\nlo entres completamente, como ahora estará un poco torcido, tienes que ponerlo\nrecto para que encajen las pestañas del esp en el soporte.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"b9gXTB57TC"}],"key":"suzucF06JC"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sacando los cuatro tornillos torx T-9 llegamos al mecanismo","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"ZSdinPYCdg"}],"key":"c1NSllv2GJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Veréis que tiene una rueda codificada con agujeros color bronce, intentad no\ntocarla con los dedos.","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"DTRDWTWHat"}],"key":"Wyo1vbVAH6"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Si os fijáis, tiene una pequeña muesca o flecha en el eje central y aparte de\nlos agujeros cuadrados y rectangulares tiene dos agujeros redondos","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"j2dbXgkRQa"}],"key":"SoHixsAOaS"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Además tiene una pequeña ruleta, marcada en la foto, que tiene una parte\nmetalizada","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"kQjzVBYfcz"}],"key":"yeZGEtUBtH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cuando está centrada está parte metalizada queda escondida detrás de la rueda de\nbronce","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"WMprkdGQqM"}],"key":"OUZGxrsl1Y"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"En la parte inferior tal como lo vemos tiene cuatro sensores que detectan el\nmovimiento de esta rueda y la dirección.","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"WpfJW5dOcO"}],"key":"LsQSfM6Ar1"},{"type":"image","url":"/build/1-83c508a786bbc20756f973c83e28a48d.png","width":"800px","align":"center","class":"bg-primary mb-1","key":"d3EVoM3q1l","urlSource":"./images/sensor-de-giro/1.png"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Como el volante da más de una vuelta en cada sentido, cuando hace una vuelta\ncompleta en el sentido del reloj, tal como la estamos viendo, se mueve la ruleta\ny vemos aparecer la parte metalizada fuera de la rueda codificada.","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"key":"O5jntIq8iR"}],"key":"Fl42QhzGh0"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Si damos otra vuelta girará un poco más la ruleta y saldrá toda la parte\nmetalizada como se puede ver.","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"Uz9goFTSm8"}],"key":"KpAZSI0rYH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Si continuamos girando dará algo más de media vuelta y notaremos una pequeña\nresistencia al giro, no hay que forzarlo ya que es la espiral que lleva las\nseñales del airbag y las levas al otro lado, si se forzara podría romperse","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"aw4rlYPxQ2"}],"key":"Hfk83G3FhQ"},{"type":"image","url":"/build/2-40fb246bb2be3fb2a7974081c5215590.png","width":"800px","align":"center","class":"bg-primary mb-1","key":"xBdp9x2D9F","urlSource":"./images/sensor-de-giro/2.png"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Si giramos en sentido contrario las más de dos vueltas que hemos girado y\ncontinuamos girando contra el reloj (a izquierdas), pasará lo mismo pero al\nrevés, a la que demos una vuelta completa aparecerá la parte metalizada de la\nruleta por la parte de abajo.","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"key":"ex6LREDBSI"}],"key":"BVdVrkJw7G"},{"type":"image","url":"/build/